1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,578
A special case: apomixis.

2
00:00:02,578 --> 00:00:08,242
A seed forms without any fertilization, so the embryo is a clone of its mother.

3
00:00:08,242 --> 00:00:16,197
In citrus and mango, extra embryos grow out of the nucellus beside the normal one: nucellar polyembryony.

4
00:00:16,197 --> 00:00:22,304
Breeders love apomixis, because it could fix a hybrid's vigour for ever.

